/*
 * Declares the SemanticIndex, which answers what entity a position of the
 * source names.
 *
 * While validation runs, every token declaring an entity or referring to one
 * is recorded as an Occurrence, so a position is resolved by the occurrence
 * whose token covers it, and the declaration and the references of an entity
 * are the occurrences naming it.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::index::implem
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/index/implem.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-01
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
